    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Inferna \u2013 Your Adventure in a Living Fantasy World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the world of <i>Inferna</i>, a free-to-play MMORPG that blends the best of classic role-playing elements with modern mechanics. Dive into an open, dynamic world full of danger, challenges, and opportunities\u2014forge your hero, embark on thrilling quests, and create your own legacy!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A World of Endless Possibilities</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Open World:</strong> Explore the stunning landscapes of <i>Inferna</i>, from arid deserts to icy peaks. Encounter ancient creatures, dangerous monsters, and other adventurers along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Living Environment:</strong> Experience dynamic weather, a day-night cycle, and an interactive world that reacts to your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deadly Rifts:</strong> Face hordes of monsters emerging from hellish rifts. Collect rare materials and challenge colossal bosses.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Combat System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tab-Target &amp; Hack-and-Slash Hybrid:</strong> Enjoy the best of both worlds with a unique combat system combining fast-paced action and tactical strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PvP Battles:</strong> Compete against rival factions or engage in thrilling arena fights for glory and rewards.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Customization and Progression</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Classes:</strong> Choose from <strong>Warrior</strong>, <strong>Mage</strong>, <strong>Assassin</strong>, or <strong>Half-Demon</strong>\u2014each offering unique playstyles, abilities, and deep specialization options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Skill System:</strong> Tailor your abilities to your preferred playstyle and master powerful skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Equipment:</strong> Forge epic weapons, upgrade your armor, and enchant your gear to create legendary masterpieces.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mounts and Companions</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from dozens of mounts and pets\u2014whether a majestic lion, a fire-breathing dragon, or a loyal wolf, your journey will never be lonely.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Guild System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own guild or join an existing one to complete guild missions, share resources, and unlock powerful guild skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle for territories and power alongside your guildmates or participate in epic guild events.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Regular Updates</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weekly content additions and community-driven improvements ensure a continuously evolving experience.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Lore and World of Inferna</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Shattered World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Centuries ago, <i>Pangaeus</i> was a thriving kingdom united by the Pact of Unity. But the <i>Night of Infernumantis</i> changed everything: hellish rifts tore open, monstrous creatures invaded, and the once-allied realms descended into conflict.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Caratas:</strong> A kingdom focused on military strength and survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Jerro:</strong> A realm marked by mistrust and isolation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Neutral Zones:</strong> Treacherous lands filled with mysteries, monsters, and ancient ruins.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you uncover the truth behind the fall of Pangaeus and reunite its fractured kingdoms?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Why Inferna?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fair Free-to-Play Model:</strong> No paywalls\u2014every piece of content is freely accessible. Microtransactions are limited to cosmetic items like skins, pets, and mounts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Engaged Community:</strong> Connect with other players and developers on Discord. Your feedback is vital and helps shape the game's evolution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Events and Rewards:</strong> Participate in regular events featuring boosted XP, rare drops, and seasonal festivities to keep the adventure fresh.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Ready for Your Adventure?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join thousands of players worldwide and become part of an epic story. <i>Inferna</i> awaits\u2014experience the ultimate challenge in an MMORPG that captures the heart and soul of classic role-playing games.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Inferna \u2013 Your Adventure in a Living Fantasy World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the world of <i>Inferna</i>, a free-to-play MMORPG that blends the best of classic role-playing elements with modern mechanics. Dive into an open, dynamic world full of danger, challenges, and opportunities\u2014forge your hero, embark on thrilling quests, and create your own legacy!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A World of Endless Possibilities</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Open World:</strong> Explore the stunning landscapes of <i>Inferna</i>, from arid deserts to icy peaks. Encounter ancient creatures, dangerous monsters, and other adventurers along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Living Environment:</strong> Experience dynamic weather, a day-night cycle, and an interactive world that reacts to your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deadly Rifts:</strong> Face hordes of monsters emerging from hellish rifts. Collect rare materials and challenge colossal bosses.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Combat System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tab-Target &amp; Hack-and-Slash Hybrid:</strong> Enjoy the best of both worlds with a unique combat system combining fast-paced action and tactical strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PvP Battles:</strong> Compete against rival factions or engage in thrilling arena fights for glory and rewards.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Customization and Progression</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Classes:</strong> Choose from <strong>Warrior</strong>, <strong>Mage</strong>, <strong>Assassin</strong>, or <strong>Half-Demon</strong>\u2014each offering unique playstyles, abilities, and deep specialization options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Skill System:</strong> Tailor your abilities to your preferred playstyle and master powerful skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Equipment:</strong> Forge epic weapons, upgrade your armor, and enchant your gear to create legendary masterpieces.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mounts and Companions</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from dozens of mounts and pets\u2014whether a majestic lion, a fire-breathing dragon, or a loyal wolf, your journey will never be lonely.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Guild System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own guild or join an existing one to complete guild missions, share resources, and unlock powerful guild skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle for territories and power alongside your guildmates or participate in epic guild events.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Regular Updates</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weekly content additions and community-driven improvements ensure a continuously evolving experience.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Lore and World of Inferna</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Shattered World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Centuries ago, <i>Pangaeus</i> was a thriving kingdom united by the Pact of Unity. But the <i>Night of Infernumantis</i> changed everything: hellish rifts tore open, monstrous creatures invaded, and the once-allied realms descended into conflict.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Caratas:</strong> A kingdom focused on military strength and survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Jerro:</strong> A realm marked by mistrust and isolation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Neutral Zones:</strong> Treacherous lands filled with mysteries, monsters, and ancient ruins.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you uncover the truth behind the fall of Pangaeus and reunite its fractured kingdoms?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Why Inferna?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fair Free-to-Play Model:</strong> No paywalls\u2014every piece of content is freely accessible. Microtransactions are limited to cosmetic items like skins, pets, and mounts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Engaged Community:</strong> Connect with other players and developers on Discord. Your feedback is vital and helps shape the game's evolution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Events and Rewards:</strong> Participate in regular events featuring boosted XP, rare drops, and seasonal festivities to keep the adventure fresh.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Ready for Your Adventure?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join thousands of players worldwide and become part of an epic story. <i>Inferna</i> awaits\u2014experience the ultimate challenge in an MMORPG that captures the heart and soul of classic role-playing games.</p>",
    "short_description": "Inferna is a player-friendly, free-to-play open-world MMORPG with unique combat system and a game world that sets no limits to the game experience.",
